riptional repression\\\",\\n          \\\"Unseen-perturbation prediction setting: held-out perturbations have zero training cells\\\",\\n          \\\"Control condition: exact control label(s) MUST be confirmed from obs metadata before any analysis; do not assume 'control' or 'NTC' exists. If multiple control types exist (e.g., non-targeting, safe-targeting/intergenic), define the union as the control set and justify the choice; document the exact obs column and values used. If no control label is found, halt and report as a critical blocker.\\\"\\n        ],\\n        \\\"experimental_protocol\\\": \\\"Pooled CRISPRi screen in K562 cells; single-cell RNA-seq (likely 10x-based) with perturbation identity recovered from guide capture/assignment. Expression stored as counts-per-10k followed by log1p. Predictions must be produced for each held-out perturbation's mean expression vector across all genes in the same order and normalization. Training restricted to cellforge_input.h5ad only; no external copies of the screen may be used.\\\",\\n        \\\"controls\\\": [\\n          \\\"Non-targeting control guides (NTC) \\u2014 confirm label from obs; if absent, document and use next available control type\\\",\\n          \\\"Safe-targeting / intergenic control guides (if present; confirm from obs); if present, define union with NTC as control set and justify\\\",\\n          \\\"Control mean expression used as baseline for delta-based metrics (pearson_delta); control mean must be computed on the same log1p CP10k scale as the stored matrix\\\",\\n          \\\"Control cells should be filtered with the same QC criteria as perturbed cells to avoid bias in control mean estimation\\\"\\n        ],\\n        \\\"replicates\\\": \\\"Likely multiple guide RNAs per target gene and pooled cells; biological replication across guides and possibly across experimental batches/lanes. Exact replicate structure must be confirmed from obs metadata (guide ID, target gene, batch/lane, repli